cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the original scientific sources for the algorithms used; see docs/references.md."
title: "The Langevin Algorithms Family (LaFA)"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
abstract: "Langevin algorithms in PyTorch: unadjusted Langevin (ULA), Metropolis-adjusted Langevin (MALA), kinetic and adaptive sampling, Stein variational inference and Bayesian uncertainty quantification, with reproducible inverse-problem tutorials."
keywords:
  - Langevin algorithms
  - Langevin dynamics
  - unadjusted Langevin algorithm
  - Metropolis-adjusted Langevin algorithm
  - Markov chain Monte Carlo
  - PyTorch
  - Bayesian inference
  - uncertainty quantification
  - inverse problems
  - Stein variational inference
authors:
